sec.p:
This analysis involved 16 species: the 7 newly sequenced ones (including 
A. arenicola
) and 9 previously published genomes (Table S2). Orthofinder v2.5.4 (Emms and Kelly 2019) and CAFE5 v5.1.0 (Mendes et al. 2021) were used to find expanded or contracted gene families. Orthofinder was set to use Diamond v0.9.29 (Buchfink et al. 2015), MAFFT v7.453, and IQtree v2.1.2 (Minh et al. 2020). Further, we used Cafeplotter v0.2.0 (https://github.com/moshi4/CafePlotter, accessed on 1 January 2024) to create graphs.
